  "text": "\n\t Town Clerk | Town of Strafford NH \n\t\t\t\t\t\t Search for: \nFollow \n\t\t\t\t\t\t Search for: \nHome \nAbout \nBow Lake \nStrafford \t\t \nBoards & Commissions \nBoard of Selectmen \nConservation Commission \nMaster Plan - Subcommittees \t\t \nPlanning Board \nZoning Board of Adjustment \nTown Offices Appointed & Elected \nTown Report & Meeting Minutes \t\t \nCommunity Services \n Strafford Fire Department  \r\nEmergency 911 \n Bow Lake Station (603)664-6863 \n Strafford Police Department   \n Emergency 911 \n Dispatch (603) 664-5644 \nBusiness Line (603) 664-7462 \nCommunity Links \nHill Library \nRecycling Center \nStrafford Fire, Rescue & Burn Permits \t\t \nStrafford Police Department \nStrafford Post Office \nStrafford Schools \nStrafford School Board \t\t \nDepartments \nAdministrator/Board of Selectmen \nBuilding Inspectors \nEmergency Management \nHealth Officer \t\t \nHuman Services \nPlanning & Zoning Office \nProperty Assessor’s Office \nTown Offices Directory & Hours \t\t \nTax Collector \nTown Clerk \n Town Clerk & Tax Collector Services  \r\nAuto Title & Reg, Boat Reg, Dog Lic, E911, Elections & Voter Reg, Hunting & Fishing Lic, Marriage Lic, Notary, OHRV/Snowmobile Reg, Property Taxes, Vital Rec \n                                         Home \r\n/ \nTown Clerk \t\t\t\t\t \r\nTown Clerk \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Moved From Out of State \nApr 22, 2022  |  Town Clerk ,  Uncategorized \nWelcome to Strafford! Proof of residency is required for new residents to title and/or register vehicles in Strafford. This is done IN PERSON at the Town Clerk's Office. You will need proof of identity such as a driver's license and one proof of residency.... \n read more \t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Moved In State \nApr 20, 2022  |  Town Clerk \nWelcome to Strafford! Proof of residency is required for new residents to title and/or register vehicles in Strafford. This is done IN PERSON at the Town Clerk's Office. You will need proof of identity such as a driver's license and one proof of residency. Acceptable... \n read more \t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Top Dog Contestants \nApr 1, 2022  |  Town Clerk \nStrafford's Top Dog Contest - License your dog and email their photo to townclerk@strafford.nh.gov  \n read more \t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t E-911 Administration \nJan 20, 2022  |  Town Clerk \nContact Information Terri Marsh, E-911 Liaison 12 Mountain View Drive Strafford, NH 03884 603-664-2192 ext.102 603-664-7276 (Fax) Mailing Address Terri Marsh, E-911 Liaison P.O. Box 23 Center Strafford, NH 03815 E-911 Information You must have an E-911 number before... \n read more \t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t OHRV & Snowmobile Registration / Fishing & Hunting License \nJan 20, 2022  |  Town Clerk \nNH FISH & GAME Website Visit the NH Fish & Game Website for Online Licenses and Registrations The Town Clerk and Deputy Clerk are agents authorized by NH Fish & Game to issue: NH OHRV Registration (May 1 - April 30) NH Snowmobile Registration (May 1 -... \n read more \t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Notary Services \nJan 20, 2022  |  Town Clerk \nNH Secretary of State - Information on Notary Public Services We offer notary services at the town offices free of charge. A valid photo ID is required. Appointments: If you have more than two documents to be notarized an appointment is required. Call 603 664-2192... \n read more \t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Boat Registrations \nJan 19, 2022  |  Town Clerk \nNH DMV Website The Town Clerk and Deputy Clerk are Certified Boat Agents for the State of NH.  ALL boat transactions require a valid driver's license.  Boat Registration Renewals can be done in person, by mail, or by phone. Add $5 agent fee to the DMV... \n read more \t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t NH Vital Records \nJan 19, 2022  |  Town Clerk \nNH Vital Record Laws The Town Clerk and Deputy Clerk are authorized by the NH Secretary of State - Vital Record Department to supply Certified Copies (Abstracts) for events that occurred in New Hampshire. New Hampshire vital records are considered to be private and... \n read more \t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Motor Vehicle Transactions \nJan 19, 2022  |  Town Clerk \nNH DMV Website The Town Clerk and Deputy Clerk are certified municipal agents for the NH DMV. Drivers Privacy Act: NH RSA 260:14 establishes that DMV records are confidential. Photo ID Required: NH RSA 261:148 requires a valid ID be presented for ALL in person motor... \n read more \t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t NH Marriage License \nJan 19, 2022  |  Forms & Applications ,  Town Clerk \nNH MARRIAGE LAWS The Town Clerk and Deputy Clerk are authorized by NH Secretary of State - Vital Record Department to issue NH Marriage Licenses. To obtain a NH Marriage License both parties must appear in person. No appointment needed.  A NH Marriage License is... \n read more \t\t\t\n« Older Entries \nSTRAFFORD NH MAP \n(Click to view pdf) \nSTRAFFORD TOWN HALL \n12 Mountain View Drive \nStrafford, NH 03884 \nMailing Address: \nPO Box 23 \nCtr. Strafford, NH 03815 \nPhone:   603-664-2192 \nFax:  603-664-7276 \nCover Photos by Bill & Linda Hodgdon \n© 2026 All Rights Reserved  | Town of Strafford NH   \n| Website developed and hosted by  CharlesWorks \nHome \nFire & Safety \nPolice Department \nStrafford Schools \nTown Office Directory \t\t \nHome \nAbout \nBow Lake \t \nStrafford \nBoards & Commissions \nBoard of Selectmen \t \nConservation Commission \t \nMaster Plan – Subcommittees \t \nPlanning Board \t \nZoning Board of Adjustment \t \nTown Report & Meeting Minutes \t \nTown Offices Appointed & Elected \nCommunity Services \nCommunity Links \t \nHill Library \t \nRecycling Center \t \nStrafford Fire, Rescue & Burn Permits \t \nStrafford Police Department \t \nStrafford Post Office \t \nStrafford Schools \t \nStrafford School Board \nDepartments \nBuilding Inspectors \t \nAdministrator/Board of Selectmen \t \nEmergency Management \t \nHealth Officer \t \